<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FIT raises yr headline shr, div increased.</title>
<headline>FIT raises yr headline shr, div increased.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline			 75.8    vs    56.8</p>
<p>    - attrib, including exceps   83.0    vs    175.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)	  28.5 making 39.0    vs    32.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income		   154.1    vs    321.2</p>
<p>    Headline earnings	     140.7    vs    104.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			   256.6    vs    192.8</p>
<p>    Tax				  24.5    vs    17.2</p>
<p>    Interest paid		    83.2    vs    70.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		13.4    vs    217.0</p>
<p>Div payable April 30</p>
<p>on register March 27</p>
<p>Full name: First International Trust Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Shareholders may elect to receive capitalisation shares in lieu of a cash dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
